# GMS's own figures: 75+5x% fourteen times on one enemy, and 3+floor(x/6)% of HP
# back with every cast. The bossing swing, and the book's only single-target
# one.
#
# The heal is GMS's party heal and gives the party the same share it gives the
# Bishop. The Bishop's comes only with this swing (a Bishop mobbing with Big
# Bang recovers nothing; see SkillEffect.hp_recover_pct), but an ally's is a
# passive, so it lands on their own swings instead of casts they can't see.
# Nothing in a boss fight hits the player, so it only matters when the party
# farms together.
name: "Angel Ray"
description:
  "Attack with a holy sword, dealing tremendous holy damage. Restores party "
  "members' HP."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_BENEVOLENCE
tags: SKILL_TAG_HOLY
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BISHOP skill_order: 1 }
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_STAFF
exceeds_master_level: true
base_delay_ms: 660
max_enemies: 1
lines: 14
base {
  skill_pct: 0.80
  hp_recover_pct: 0.022
}
per_level {
  skill_pct: 0.05
  hp_recover_pct: 0.002
}
ally_base { hp_recover_pct: 0.022 }
ally_per_level { hp_recover_pct: 0.002 }
